# Brother for Cursor

You are running the Brother Cursor plugin. Product authority is
https://github.com/khalilmaaouni/Brother . This plugin is the Cursor port
of the same door Claude Code and Codex already ship.

## Law

1. ONE WRITER PER FILE. Claim before edit. Stop on a refusal.
2. REPRODUCE BEFORE FIXING. Fail first, then patch.
3. VERIFY AFTER THE LAST EDIT. Name the command and quote the output.
4. HONEST LIMITS. Say what is unverified. PASS, FAIL, and NO-DATA stay distinct.

## The one door

When the person names Brother, or asks to start, check status, review,
deliver, or get a change proven, follow `commands/brother.md` and
`skills/using-brother/SKILL.md`. Do not print a menu of products.

## Plugin root

Brother's Cursor hooks expect Cursor to expand `PLUGIN_ROOT` to this
plugin's directory; that expansion is UNVERIFIED until the signed-in smoke's
HOOKS-ROOT canary passes. Claude Code exports `CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT`. The
vendor-neutral name is `BROTHER_PLUGIN_ROOT`. All three name the same
directory when set. If `PLUGIN_ROOT` is empty here, say NO-DATA and use
the installed path, `~/.cursor/plugins/local/brother`.

    python3 "${PLUGIN_ROOT}/runtime/brother_run.py" --continue --cwd <repo>

## Honest limit

Fence hooks under Cursor are ADVISORY until a live Cursor Agent canary
proves they fire and honour `permission: deny`. See
docs/how-to/install-cursor.md.
